{
  "info": {
    "name": "LMS Audit Logs – CRUD Testing",
    "_postman_id": "lms-audit-logs-crud-testing",
    "description": "## LMS Audit Logs – CRUD Testing\n\nThis collection triggers every action logged to Firestore `system_audit_logs` and reads them back.\n\n### Logged Actions\n| Action | Triggered By |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `USER_SYNC` | POST /me/sync |\n| `CREATE_COURSE` | POST /courses |\n| `UPDATE_COURSE` | PATCH /courses/:id |\n| `DELETE_COURSE` | DELETE /courses/:id |\n| `CREATE_SECTION` | POST /courses/:id/sections |\n| `UPDATE_SECTION` | PATCH /courses/:id/sections/:id |\n| `DELETE_SECTION` | DELETE /courses/:id/sections/:id |\n| `CREATE_LECTURE` | POST /courses/:id/sections/:id/lectures |\n| `UPDATE_LECTURE` | PATCH /courses/:id/sections/:id/lectures/:id |\n| `DELETE_LECTURE` | DELETE /courses/:id/sections/:id/lectures/:id |\n| `UPDATE_ROLE` | PUT /admin/users/:uid/role |\n| `UPLOAD_SIGNED_URL` | POST /uploads/signed-url |\n| `UPLOAD_CONFIRMED` | POST /uploads/confirm |\n| `ENROLLMENT_CREATED` | POST /courses/:id/enroll |\n| `PAYMENT_INITIATED` | POST /payments/checkout |\n| `PAYMENT_SUCCESS` | Webhook: POST /payments/webhook |\n| `PAYMENT_FAILED` | Webhook: POST /payments/webhook |\n\n### Prerequisites (Production Firebase)\n1. Update `backend/.env` with your Firebase project credentials\n2. Run: `cd backend && node scripts/setup-production-users.js`\n3. Run: `cd backend && npm run start:dev`\n4. Run: `docker compose -f backend/docker-compose.yml up -d redis`\n\n### Run Order\n00 → 01 → 02 → 03 → 04 → 05 → 06 → 07 → 08\n\n### View Logs\nFirebase Console → Firestore → system_audit_logs",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "backendUrl",     "value": "http://localhost:3001/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "firebaseProject","value": "learning-management-syst-3cc3a", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "firebaseApiKey", "value": "AIzaSyCHloBAkTxce3h1HBhmmzcDVVcMsLDszFk", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "superAdminToken","value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminToken",     "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "instructorToken","value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "studentToken",   "value": "", "type": "string" },
